{"step_index":479,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:49:27Z","input_tokens":2782,"cache_read_tokens":205174,"output_tokens":2763,"thinking":"The initial setup completes swiftly; project structure and core components now require definition. Application architecture involves a dashboard root, HTML entry point, and a `src` directory housing the main application logic, styling, and data types. This structure provides a clear separation of concerns, enabling efficient development.\n\n\nThe application's architecture is now understood, focusing on the visual components and trading engines. The header displays the Grok Bot logo and mode, while the core trading simulation is managed within the engine. Several components, including the copy feed, balance cards, and trader bench, drive the user interface.\n\n\nThe user interface layout requires the addition of a mode toggle and simulation speed controls to the header. Top grid card designs for balance, total P&L, copying trader details, and the fire rule are confirmed. Middle grid includes balance history chart and a planned future column.\n\n\nA visual representation of the trader activity is built, marking \"fired\" traders after two consecutive losses with a distinct line. The timeline incorporates color bands showing the active trader during each phase. The copy feed now clearly reflects buys, sells, and firing events for each trader, and the bottom section accurately identifies traders being copied and their current status.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  :root {\\n    --bg-cosmic: #070913;\\n    --card-surface: #0e1222;\\n    --card-border: #1a2238;\\n    --neon-green: #22c55e;\\n    --neon-coral: #f87171;\\n    --neon-blue: #38bdf8;\\n    --neon-amber: #f59e0b;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    background-color: var(--bg-cosmic);\\n    background-image: \\n      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -20%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12), transparent),\\n      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 80% 80%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08), transparent);\\n    color: #e2e8f0;\\n    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Monospace font for logs and code numbers */\\n.font-mono-numbers {\\n  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\\n  font-feature-settings: 'tnum' on, 'zero' on;\\n}\\n\\n.font-display {\\n  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom cyber scrollbar */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 5px;\\n  height: 5px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: rgba(14, 18, 34, 0.6);\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);\\n  border-radius: 4px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);\\n}\\n\\n/* Card glass styles */\\n.cyber-card {\\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 22, 44, 0.85) 0%, rgba(11, 15, 30, 0.95) 100%);\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(40, 52, 86, 0.6);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\\n}\\n\\n.cyber-card-active {\\n  border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);\\n  box-shadow: 0 0 25px -4px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);\\n}\\n\"","Description":"\"Writing index.css with cyber dark styling\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/index.css\"","toolAction":"\"Writing index.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Create CSS styling and variables\""}}]}
